	(text "Hot turn-on slew limit: C10 from VIN to the gate (via D12) diverts the VOM1271 current,\nabout 30 uA at IF 20 mA -> ~0.45 V/ms; 1 mF load draws ~0.45 A. D12 keeps C10 out of the\nturn-off path; R15 resets C10 after turn-off. No DC path: C10 blocks."
